{"index":109,"nameArabic":"الكافرون","ayahs":[{"index":1,"text":"قُلْ يَٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ","bismillah":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","translation":"Say: O disbelievers"},{"index":2,"text":"لَآ أَعْبُدُ مَا تَعْبُدُونَ","translation":"I worship not that which ye worship"},{"index":3,"text":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","translation":"Nor worship ye that which I worship"},{"index":4,"text":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٌ مَّا عَبَدتُّمْ","translation":"And I shall not worship that which ye worship"},{"index":5,"text":"وَلَآ أَنتُمْ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعْبُدُ","translation":"Nor will ye worship that which I worship"},{"index":6,"text":"لَكُمْ دِينُكُمْ وَلِىَ دِينِ","translation":"Unto you your religion, and unto me my religion"}]}